sequenceDiagram
    participant GitLab
    participant S3
    participant SecretsManager as AWS Secrets Manager
    participant ConfigServer as Spring Config Server
    participant ConfigClient as API (Config Client)

    GitLab->>S3: Push config files (application.yml etc.)
    Note right of GitLab: CI/CD sync to S3 after merge to main

    ConfigClient->>ConfigServer: GET /{appName}/{profile}
    Note right of ConfigClient: On bootstrap or scaling out

    ConfigServer->>S3: Fetch config for app/profile
    ConfigServer->>SecretsManager: Fetch secrets for app/profile
    ConfigServer-->>ConfigClient: Return merged config JSON

    Note over ConfigClient: Secrets decrypted using encrypt.key/salt

    loop Every 15 mins
        ConfigClient->>ConfigServer: GET /{appName}/{profile}
        ConfigServer->>S3: Fetch latest config
        ConfigServer->>SecretsManager: Fetch latest secrets
        ConfigServer-->>ConfigClient: Return merged config
        alt Changes detected
            ConfigClient->>ConfigClient: Rebind @RefreshScope beans
        else No changes
            ConfigClient->>ConfigClient: No refresh triggered
        end
    end